# The user's own 1920x1080 source image at the repo root. Kept on disk, never
# committed (it is not an app asset - see the OG/social-card note in agents/),
# and ignored so it can't ride along in a `git add -A`.
Ylem.jpg

# Gradle build cache (mod/)
mod/.gradle/

# --- CurseForge API key (build-time secret, never committed) ----------------
# The ONE key every Cubeon build ships is written to cubeon/_cf_key.py by
# .github/workflows/build.yml from the CURSEFORGE_API_KEY secret. This repo is
# public, so the generated module must never be committed: a committed key is a
# revoked key. Dev machines may also create it locally; it is gitignored here.
cubeon/_cf_key.py

# --- Discord bot (local management layer & credentials) ---
discord-bot/
